      <h3>Vision</h3>
      <p>A world where all people flourish and grow as they age, staying connected with care and support within their communities.</p>
      <h3>Values</h3>
      <ul class="list">
        <li>Connection and friendship in every decade.</li>
        <li>Independence supported by neighbors.</li>
