<section class="section">
  <div class="shell split">
    <div class="panel">
      <h2>The Village movement</h2>
      <p>WPV is part of a nationwide movement of nearly 300 local Villages redefining how we age in place. Villages are volunteer-powered networks of members, staff, and partners who share activities, programs, and support.</p>
      <p>We are not a facility or a caregiving agency. We are a community that keeps people connected to neighbors, resources, and opportunities to give and receive help.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card-grid">
      <article class="card">
        <h3>Social connection</h3>
        <p>Gatherings, interest groups, and friendly check-ins that keep everyone engaged.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <h3>Practical support</h3>
        <p>Rides, errands, tech help, and light tasks provided by screened volunteers.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <h3>Shared learning</h3>
        <p>Workshops and resources that help members navigate aging with confidence.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

